WEBVTT

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:30.097
The second thing was
that after these vaccines were approved,

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:35.297
again, some gaps in production came about.

00:04:35.297 --> 00:04:39.563
And so therefore, suddenly Big Pharma
started partnering with each other,

00:04:39.597 --> 00:04:41.963
which really hasn't happened before,

00:04:41.997 --> 00:04:47.263
where, say, Novartis decided
to help out Pfizer

00:04:47.297 --> 00:04:50.463
in its manufacturing gaps.

00:04:50.497 --> 00:04:55.230
And the same thing happened with Merck
now trying to help out J an J

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.097
with its manufacturing needs.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:01.497
So there's been a lot of interesting
partnerships and collaborations